      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unfortunately we cannot define another `all_aconfig_declarations` module type, because the module is a singleton module (i.e. only one module of the type is allowed to be defined in the bp files). I believe the wear api files should be conditionally added in the same module via soong config vars or go/soong-selects.",
