      "writtenOn": "2025-01-17T07:54:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My goal is to create a file in prebuilts/sdk/\u003cversion\u003e/ that includes all the flags that have been used with @FlaggedApi. Eventually this will be used to enforce that we never re-use a flag if it has already been part of an API finalization.\n\nI don\u0027t think adding Wear or other non-platform vertical flags to that file makes much sense because other verticals will have their own prebuilts/sdk/opt/\u003cvertical\u003e directories.\n\nHappy to continue this conversation but over mail/chat/gvc, not in Gerrit. :)",
      "parentUuid": "07679238_1c58ea7a",
      "revId": "6543483382da72963d4660e47cef91dd4c80349e",
